00:46:31.840 --> 00:46:35.920
Like, you can even kind of see when he bends out when you're, like, moving him.

00:46:36.080 --> 00:46:38.980
You could see that, like, they maybe even animated it.

00:46:39.080 --> 00:46:43.820
