00:47:45.860 --> 00:47:49.360
and forth, like some sort of, like, football training drill the whole time.

00:47:49.600 --> 00:47:54.420
So I do want to see what's going on in the way he's walking back and forth so smoothly.

00:47:55.020 --> 00:47:57.740
Sean? We all know why you want to see his feet, Joe.

